* Walkways (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script and our own art).
* Where they go was inspired by JayD's "Plato Project" (Creatures 2 COB)
* and Helen and NORNGod's "Walls and Bridges Pack"; none of their files are
* used. Sprites zbw1-zbw4 are drawn by art/bamboo.py. Run by
* openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder); safe to repeat.
* ROOM takes all of a room's data, so each room's own values are passed back.

* Across the waterfall, upper: from the scaffold's top deck (room 68, y 1322)
* to the treehouse's upper deck (room 61, y 1285). Room 66 (x 2593-2904)
* reaches down to y 1322 and gets a floor rising from 1322 to 1285.
room 66 2593 990 2904 1322 room 66 4 room 66 5 room 66 6 room 66 7 room 66 8 room 66 9 room 66 12 room 66 13 room 66 14 room 66 15 room 66 16 room 66 17 room 66 19
ssfc 66 2 0 0 311 37
setv door 0 68 66 255

* Across the waterfall, lower: from the scaffold's lower deck (room 67,
* y 1453) down to the treehouse's lower deck (room 60, y 1544). Room 65
* (x 2593-3006) now starts below room 66, at y 1322, with a floor falling
* from 1453 to 1544.
room 65 2593 1322 3006 1544 room 65 4 room 65 5 room 65 6 room 65 7 room 65 8 room 65 9 room 65 12 room 65 13 room 65 14 room 65 15 room 65 16 room 65 17 room 65 19
ssfc 65 2 0 91 413 0
setv door 0 67 65 255

* Under the falls, by the waterwheel: from the planted rock ledge (room 97,
* y 2150) across the mist (room 192, falling to y 2180) and down to the
* ground by the great tree (room 58, y 2261 from x 3310).
ssfc 192 2 0 30 145 0
ssfc 58 3 0 219 250 138 455 138
* (and its floor value 0, not 10: the line is then solid for everything, and
* an object found under it, such as a berry rolled in from the pocket under
* the bridge, whose floor is ~100 px lower where they meet, is lifted back
* onto it; berries lay in the dirt under the ground there, owner 2026-11-10)
room 58 3060 1996 3515 2399 room 58 4 0 room 58 6 room 58 7 room 58 8 room 58 9 room 58 12 room 58 13 room 58 14 room 58 15 room 58 16 room 58 17 room 58 19
setv door 0 97 192 255
* The walkway's deck now runs over the game's water pump (2 7 2, drinks,
* x 3030-3115, standing on the old ground at y 2261), whose top is level with
* creatures' feet up there, so they could not reach it: stand it on the
* ground just past the walkway's end instead (x 3290-3375, among the potted
* plants, drawn in front of them as before).
enum 2 7 2
  doif posl eq 3030
    doif post eq 2195 mvto 3290 2195 endi
  endi
next
* and a pipe from the old standpipe (x 3041, its cap at y 2260) along the
* ground to the pump (sprite zpip from art/pipe.py;
* plane 590: behind the walkway's posts, the plants and the pump)
enum 2 3 234 kill targ next
inst new: simp zpip 1 0 590 0 setv cls2 2 3 234 setv attr 0 mvto 3030 2244 slow
* its inlet fitting on the pump's side, in front of the pump (covers the
* pump picture's own hose into the ground)
enum 2 3 235 kill targ next
inst new: simp zpin 1 0 8001 0 setv cls2 2 3 235 setv attr 0 mvto 3290 2242 slow
* Under the deck is a pocket (room 206, x 2800-3060, sloping down to the
* pool) with no way out; creatures cannot get in now, but fruit could still
* drop through 192's floor and roll down out of reach, and the world starts
* with berries lying there. Close that floor to fruit too (permeability 100,
* below objects' size 127) and set the berries on the deck.
setv door 0 192 206 100
setv var0 0
enum 2 25 11
  doif posl ge 2800
    doif posl lt 3060
      doif post gt 2185
        setv var1 var0 mulv var1 14 addv var1 2925
        setv var2 var1 subv var2 2915 mulv var2 30 divv var2 145 addv var2 2130
        mvto var1 var2
        addv var0 1
      endi
    endi
  endi
next

* Nothing grows on the waterwheel walkway (owner): the game's plants on the
* old ground beneath its deck (pear and gourd plants 2 24, carrots 2 11,
* mushrooms 2 15) stuck up through the bridge, and creatures can no longer
* reach that ground. Plants, seeds, leaves and roots (genus 4, 11, 15, 21-24)
* whose middle is between x 2900 and 3290 with their foot from y 2100 to
* 2290 (carrots grow below ground) are removed now, and a watcher (2 1 142, invisible) removes any that
* turn up there later. Food lying on the deck is left alone.
enum 2 4 0
  setv var1 posl addv var1 posr divv var1 2
  doif var1 ge 2900
    doif var1 le 3290
      doif posb ge 2100
        doif posb le 2290 kill targ endi
      endi
    endi
  endi
next
