* The east sea's east dock to the land beyond (after JayD's Plato Project,
* which opened this): room 233 (x 7380-7530) lies between the dock (room
* 142, y 650) and the land east of it (room 143, y 693), where the great
* tree's root slopes down; its doors were too small for creatures, so the
* dock and its boat were cut off from the east. Its floor now follows the
* root from 649 down to 693, and the dock and land doors are open.
* (and the hand can put things down on it: the game's room allowed nothing
* to be dropped in it; 2026-11-22)
room 233 7380 340 7530 693 room 233 4 room 233 5 room 233 6 room 233 7 room 233 8 room 233 9 room 233 12 room 233 13 room 233 14 room 233 15 room 233 16 room 233 17 1
ssfc 233 2 0 44 150 0
setv door 0 142 233 255
setv door 0 233 143 255
